hadiths[83]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3122","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Donon Asr ki namazon ki hifazat karo: suraj tuloo hone se pehle ki namaz aur us ke ghuroob hone se pehle ki namaz."
"3123","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ansar se mohabbat iman ki nishani hai aur Ansar se bughz munafiq ki nishani hai."
"3124","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhari duniya mein se mujhe aurat aur khushbu mehboob banayi gayin; aur meri aankhon ki thandak namaz mein rakhi gayi hai."
"3125","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke khilaal karne wale kitne achche hain."
"3126","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag khwahishon se dhaanpi gayi hai aur jannat napasand cheezon se dhaanpi gayi hai."
"3127","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne baap ki taraf se hajj karo aur umra karo."
"3128","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehle apni taraf se hajj karo, phir Shubruma ki taraf se hajj karo."
"3129","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Raaste ki hadd saat haath hai."
"3130","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen mein naafiz ki jane wali aik hadd zameen walon ke liye chaalees subah baarish hone se behtar hai."
"3131","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bani Israel se riwayatein bayan karo, koi harj nahi."
"3132","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo amanat ke sath na ho us ka nafa haraam hai."
"3133","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ka thora bhi haraam hai jo zyada nasha karta ho."
"3134","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne sharaab haraam ki hai aur har nashawar cheez haraam hai."
"3135","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag par haraam hai har narm, mulayam, aasaan shakhs jo logon se qareeb ho."
"3136","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do aankhon par haraam hai ke aag unhein chhue: wo aankh jo Allah ke khauf se royi aur wo aankh jo ehl-e-kufr se Islam aur us ke rehne walon ki hifazat mein raat guzare."
"3137","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Resham aur sone ka libaas meri ummat ke mardon par haraam kiya gaya hai aur un ki aurton ke liye halal kiya gaya hai."
"3138","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Madina ke donon kinaron ke darmiyan meri zaban par haraam kiya gaya hai."
"3139","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sharaab ki tijarat haraam ki gayi hai."
"3140","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman ke maal ki hurmat us ke khoon ki hurmat jaise hai."
"3141","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujahideen ki aurton ki hurmat baithne walon par un ki maaon ki hurmat jaise hai; aur baithne walon mein se jo aadmi mujahideen mein se kisi aadmi ke ghar walon mein us ka qaaim-muqaam bane phir un mein us se khayanat kare, magar qayamat ke din us ke liye khara kiya jayega aur use kaha jayega: Ye tumhare ghar walon mein tumhara qaaim-muqaam bana tha, pas us ki nekiyon mein se jitna chaho le lo; to wo us ke amal mein se jitna chahe lega; pas tumhara kiya khayal hai?"
"3142","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khajoor ke darakht ka harem us ki daaliyon ki pahunch hai."
"3143","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jahan ki aurton mein se tumhein ye kaafi hain: Maryam bint Imran, Khadija bint Khuwailid, Fatima bint Muhammad aur Aasiya Firaun ki biwi."
"3144","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khush-aawazi Quran ki zeenat hai."
"3145","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran ko apni aawazon se khubsurat banao; kyunke achchi aawaz Quran ko husn mein barha deti hai."
"3146","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Husain mujh se hai aur main us se hun; Allah us se mohabbat kare jo Husain se mohabbat kare; Hasan aur Husain nawaso mein se do nawase hain."
"3147","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat napasand cheezon se gheri gayi hai aur aag khwahishon se gheri gayi hai."
"3148","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shohar ka haq apni biwi par ye hai ke agar use zakhm ho aur wo use chaat le tab bhi us ka haq ada nahi kiya."
"3149","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aurat ka haq shohar par ye hai ke jab khud khaye to use khilaye, jab khud pehne to use pehnaye, chehre par na maare, bura-bhala na kahe aur ghar ke siwa kahin tark-e-talluq na kare."
"3150","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman ka haq musalman par paanch hain: salam ka jawab dena, mareez ki iyadat karna, janazon ke saath jana, dawat qubool karna aur chheenkne wale ko yarhamukallah kehna."
"3151","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman ka haq musalman par chhe hain: jab tum use milo to use salam karo; jab wo tumhein bulaye to qubool karo; jab wo tum se mashwara mange to use mashwara do; jab wo chheenke aur Alhamdulillah kahe to use yarhamukallah kaho; jab wo beemar ho to us ki iyadat karo; aur jab wo mar jaye to us ke saath jao."
"3152","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah par haq hai us ki madad jo us se haraam-karda cheezon se paak-damani talab karte hue nikah kare."
"3153","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har musalman ka haq miswak hai, Juma ke din ghusl hai aur apne ghar walon ki khushbu lagana agar ho."
"3154","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke liye har musalman par haq hai ke har saat din mein aik din ghusl kare jis mein apna sar aur apna jism dhoye."
"3155","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya ki mithaas aakhirat ki karwahat hai aur duniya ki karwahat aakhirat ki mithaas hai."
"3156","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaum ka haleef unhi mein se hai aur qaum ke bhanje unhi mein se hain."
"3157","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hamza bin Abdul Muttalib dhoodh ke rishte se mere bhai hain."
"3158","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hamza qayamat ke din shaheedon ke sardar hain."
"3159","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum se pehle walon mein se aik aadmi ka hisaab liya gaya to us ke liye koi neki nahi payi gayi siwa is ke ke wo khush-haal aadmi tha, logon se milta-julta tha, aur apne mulazimon ko hukm deta tha ke tang-dast se darguzar karein; to Allah azzawajal ne apne farishton se farmaya: Ham is ke is se zyada haqdar hain; use maaf kar do."
"3160","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mera hauz Sanaa aur Madina ke darmiyan jitna hai; us mein bartan sitaaron jaise hain."
"3161","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mera hauz maheene ki musafat jitna hai, us ke konay barabar hain, us ka paani doodh se zyada safaid hai, us ki khushbu mushk se zyada achchi hai, aur us ke piyale aasmaan ke sitaaron jaise hain; jo us mein se piyega wo kabhi pyasa nahi hoga."
"3162","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mera hauz Adan se Balqa ke Amman tak hai; us ka paani doodh se zyada safaid aur shehad se zyada meetha hai; us ke piyale aasmaan ke sitaaron ki taadaad mein hain; jo us mein se aik ghoont piyega us ke baad kabhi pyasa nahi hoga; sab se pehle us par aane wale muhajir faqeer honge jinke sar pur-ghubaar aur kapre maile honge, jo aaraam-pasand aurton se nikah nahi karte aur jin ke liye darwaze nahi khole jate."
"3163","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ham isi ke gird ghoom kar dua karte hain."
"3164","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum jahan kahin ho mujh par durood bhejo; kyunke tumhara durood mujhe pahuncha diya jata hai."
"3165","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum jahan kafir ki qabr par se guzro use aag ki khushkhabri do."
"3166","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haaiza aur nifaas wali aurat jab meeqat par aayein to ghusl karein, ehram bandhein aur Baitullah ke tawaf ke siwa tamam manasik ada karein."
"3167","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haaji: pur-ghubaar maila-kuchaila hai."
"3168","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kalonji mein maut ke siwa har bimari se shifa hai."
"3169","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khaali pet singi lagwana behtar hai; us mein shifa aur barkat hai aur hifz aur aql mein izafa karti hai; pas Jumeraat ke din Allah ki barkat par singi lagwao; Juma, Hafta aur Itwaar ke din singi lagwane se bacho; aur Peer aur Mangal ke din singi lagwao; kyunke yehi wo din hai jis mein Allah ne Ayyub ko bala se aafiyat di; aur Budh ke din singi lagwane se bacho; kyunke yehi wo din hai jis mein Ayyub aazmaish mein mubtela hue; aur korh ya bars Budh ke din ya Budh ki raat ke siwa zahir nahi hota."
"3170","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hajj-e-Mabroor ka badla jannat ke siwa kuch nahi."
"3171","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hajj har kamzor ka jihad hai."
"3172","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hajj Arafa hai; jo Muzdalifa ki raat ki fajr tuloo hone se pehle aa jaye us ne hajj pa liya; Mina ke din teen hain; pas jo do din mein jaldi kare us par koi gunah nahi aur jo der kare us par koi gunah nahi."
"3173","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haaji aur umra karne wale Allah ke wafd hain: us ne unhein bulaya to unhon ne qubool kiya; aur unhon ne us se manga to us ne unhein diya."
"3174","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hajr-e-Aswad jannat se hai."
"3175","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hajr-e-Aswad jannat ke patharon mein se hai."
"3176","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jang dhoka hai."
"3177","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Resham us ka libaas hai jis ka koi hissa nahi."
"3178","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hasab maal hai aur karam taqwa hai."
"3179","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hasan mujh se hain aur Husain Ali se hain."
"3180","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hasan aur Husain ehl-e-jannat ke naujawanon ke sardar hain."
"3181","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hasan aur Husain ehl-e-jannat ke naujawanon ke sardar hain, siwa khaala-zaad beton Isa bin Maryam aur Yahya bin Zakariya ke; aur Fatima ehl-e-jannat ki aurton ki sardar hain, siwa Maryam bint Imran ke."
"3182","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hasan aur Husain ehl-e-jannat ke naujawanon ke sardar hain aur un ke walid un donon se behtar hain."
"3183","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam saamaan ko bechne wali aur barkat ko mitane wali hai."
"3184","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Alhamdulillahi Rabbil Aalamin Umm-ul-Quran, Umm-ul-Kitaab aur Sab'a Masani hai."
"3185","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Alhamdulillahi Rabbil Aalamin wahi Sab'a Masani hai jo mujhe di gayin aur Quran-e-Azeem hai."
"3186","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bukhar qayamat ke din aag mein se momin ka hissa hai."
"3187","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bukhar aag mein se har momin ka hissa hai."
"3188","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bukhar jahannam ki bhatti hai; pas momin ko us mein se jo lage wo aag mein se us ka hissa tha."
"3189","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bukhar jahannam ki bhatti hai; pas use apne se thande paani se door karo."
"3190","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bukhar jahannam ki bhatti hai aur wo aag mein se momin ka hissa hai."
"3191","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bukhar jahannam ki lapet se hai; pas use paani se thanda karo."
"3192","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hammam meri ummat ki aurton par haraam hai."
"3193","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Halal wazeh hai aur haraam wazeh hai; aur in donon ke darmiyan mushtabeh muamle hain jinhein bahut se log nahi jaante; pas jo shubhaat se bacha us ne apni izzat aur apne deen ko bacha liya; aur jo shubhaat mein para wo haraam mein para, aise charwahe jaise jo hima ke gird charata hai, qareeb hai ke us mein par jaye. Khabardar, har baadshah ka hima hota hai; khabardar, zameen mein Allah taala ka hima us ki haraam-karda cheezein hain. Khabardar, jism mein gosht ka aik tukra hai: jab wo durust ho to poora jism durust hota hai aur jab wo bigar jaye to poora jism bigar jata hai; khabardar, wo dil hai."
"3194","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Halal wazeh hai aur haraam wazeh hai; pas jo tumhein shak mein daale use chhor do us ki taraf jo tumhein shak mein na daale."
"3195","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Halal wo hai jo Allah ne apni kitaab mein halal kiya aur haraam wo hai jo Allah ne apni kitaab mein haraam kiya; aur jis par wo khamosh raha wo us mein se hai jise us ne maaf kiya."
"3196","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haya poori ki poori khair hai."
"3197","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haya iman mein se hai."
"3198","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haya iman mein se hai; aur meri ummat mein sab se zyada haya wala Usman hai."
"3199","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haya iman mein se hai aur iman jannat mein hai; aur be-hayai sakhti mein se hai aur sakhti aag mein hai."
"3200","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haya aur iman aik saath jore gaye hain; pas jab un mein se aik uthaya jaye to doosra bhi uthaya jata hai."
"3201","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haya aur kum-goi iman ki do shaakhein hain; aur be-hayai aur bayan-baazi nifaq ki do shaakhein hain."
"3202","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haya khair ke siwa kuch nahi lati."
"3203","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saanp jinno ka maskh hain jaise bandar aur khinzeer bani Israel mein se maskh hue."
"3204","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saanp faasiq hai, bichchu faasiq hai, chooha faasiq hai aur kawa faasiq hai."
